#: templates/users/advanced.html:77 users/advanced_props.py:53
msgid ""
"Only known provider image hosts are cached (including TMDB, TVDB, "
"MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, BoardGameGeek, "
"MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu, and AniList). Manual URLs, local "
"services, placeholders, and unknown hosts stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Solo se almacenan en caché las imágenes de proveedores conocidos (incluidos "
"TMDB, TVDB, MyAnimeList, IGDB, Open Library, Hardcover, ComicVine, "
"BoardGameGeek, MusicBrainz, Pocket Casts, iTunes, Kitsu y AniList). Las URL "
"manuales, los servicios locales, las imágenes de sustitución y los "
"servidores desconocidos no cambian."

