#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:233
msgid ""
"Push your Floppy watched status onto a Jellyfin server, e.g. after re-adding "
"media or setting up a fresh Jellyfin instance."
msgstr ""
"Envía el estado de visionado de Floppy a un servidor de Jellyfin, por "
"ejemplo, después de volver a añadir contenido o de configurar una instancia "
"nueva de Jellyfin."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:249
#: users/provider_views.py:348
msgid ""
"Jellyfin rejected the API key. Floppy re-checks it on every scheduled run; "
"reconnect if the key was changed or revoked."
msgstr ""
"Jellyfin ha rechazado la clave de API. Floppy la comprueba en cada ejecución "
"programada; vuelve a conectar si se ha cambiado o revocado."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:260
msgid "Jellyfin → Floppy: auto-import history"
msgstr "Jellyfin → Floppy: importación automática del historial"

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:262
msgid ""
"No manual export needed. Floppy pulls your watch history straight from your "
"Jellyfin server: full per-play history via the Playback Reporting plugin's "
"API when it's reachable with an admin key, otherwise a one-event-per-item "
"backfill from Jellyfin's current watched state."
msgstr ""
"No hace falta exportar manualmente. Floppy obtiene el historial de visionado "
"directamente de tu servidor de Jellyfin: el historial completo de cada "
"reproducción mediante la API del complemento Playback Reporting si se puede "
"acceder con una clave de administrador; si no, recupera un evento por "
"elemento a partir del estado de visionado actual de Jellyfin."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:267
msgid "Using Playback Reporting's API (full per-play history)."
msgstr ""
"Usando la API de Playback Reporting (historial completo por reproducción)."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:269
msgid ""
"Playback Reporting's API isn't reachable with this key, so Floppy is using "
"the current-watched-state backfill instead (one event per item)."
msgstr ""
"La API de Playback Reporting no es accesible con esta clave; se usará la "
"recuperación del estado de visionado actual (un evento por elemento)."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:271
msgid "Not yet run."
msgstr "Aún no se ha ejecutado."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:274
#, python-format
msgid "Last run: %(value1)s."
msgstr "Última ejecución: %(value1)s."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:285
msgid "Import history now"
msgstr "Importar historial ahora"

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:289
msgid "Or upload a Playback Reporting TSV manually"
msgstr "O sube manualmente un TSV de Playback Reporting"

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:292
msgid ""
"Only needed if your key can't reach the Playback Reporting API (e.g. a non-"
"admin key) and you'd rather not use the current-watched-state backfill above."
msgstr ""
"Solo es necesario si tu clave no puede acceder a la API de Playback "
"Reporting (por ejemplo, una clave sin permisos de administrador) y prefieres "
"no usar la recuperación del estado de visionado actual indicada arriba."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:296
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Last import: %(value1)s (%(value2)s), %(value3)s created, %(value4)s skipped."
msgstr ""
"Última importación: %(value1)s (%(value2)s), %(value3)s creados, %(value4)s "
"omitidos."

#: templates/users/providers/integrations/jellyfin.html:310
