#: users/advanced_props.py:123
#| msgid "This is the one shared cache here. Clearing it affects"
msgid ""
"This is the one shared cache here. Clearing it affects every user on this "
"Floppy instance, not just you."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la única caché compartida; al vaciarla, afecta a todos los usuarios "
"de esta instancia de Floppy, no solo a ti."

#: users/advanced_props.py:127
#| msgid ""
#| "The next search anyone makes will be a bit slower while it re-fetches "
#| "from TMDB, TVDB, and the other providers."
msgid ""
"No data is lost. The next search anyone makes will be a bit slower while it "
"re-fetches from TMDB, TVDB, and the other providers."
msgstr ""
"No se pierde ningún dato. La siguiente búsqueda que haga cualquier usuario "
"será algo más lenta mientras se vuelven a obtener los datos de TMDB, TVDB y "
"los demás proveedores."

#: users/advanced_props.py:136
#| msgid ""
#| "Your watch history itself is not touched. This only clears the cached, "
#| "day-by-day rendering of it."
msgid ""
"Only affects your own account. Your watch history itself is not touched. "
"This only clears the cached, day-by-day rendering of it."
msgstr ""
"Solo afecta a tu cuenta. Tu historial de visionado no se modifica; solo se "
"borra su representación en caché, organizada por días."

#: users/advanced_props.py:149
#| msgid "No underlying data is touched, only the cached charts/totals."
msgid ""
"Only affects your own account. No underlying data is touched, only the "
"cached charts and totals."
msgstr ""
"Solo afecta a tu cuenta. No se modifica ningún dato original, solo los "
"gráficos y totales en caché."

#: users/advanced_props.py:153
#| msgid ""
#| "Unlike History, Statistics rebuilds in the background rather than on your "
#| "next page load. Expect placeholder"
msgid ""
"Statistics rebuild in the background rather than on your next page load. "
"Expect placeholder values for a bit until that finishes."
msgstr ""
"Las estadísticas se reconstruyen en segundo plano en lugar de al cargar la "
"siguiente página. Durante un tiempo verás valores provisionales hasta que "
"termine el proceso."

#: users/advanced_props.py:162
#| msgid ""
#| "Your recommendation rows and taste profile get recomputed from scratch. "
#| "Rows may look different or take a moment to repopulate."
msgid ""
"Only affects your own account. Your recommendation rows and taste profile "
"get recomputed from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Solo afecta a tu cuenta. Tus filas de recomendaciones y tu perfil de gustos "
"se vuelven a calcular desde cero."

#: users/advanced_props.py:166
msgid ""
"Rows may look different or take a moment to repopulate. Shared provider data "
"other users draw on is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Las filas pueden verse diferentes o tardar un momento en volver a cargarse. "
"Los datos compartidos del proveedor que utilizan otros usuarios no se ven "
"afectados."

#: users/advanced_props.py:174
#| msgid ""
#| "This runs all four clears above at once: Search (instance-wide) plus your "
#| "History, Statistics, and Discover caches."
msgid ""
"This runs all four clears at once: Search (instance-wide) plus your History, "
"Statistics, and Discover caches."
msgstr ""
"Borra las cuatro cachés a la vez: Búsqueda (de toda la instancia) y tus "
"cachés de Historial, Estadísticas y Descubrir."

#: users/advanced_props.py:178
msgid ""
"Search results go stale for every user until re-fetched. History and "
"Discover rebuild as you browse, and Statistics shows placeholders until a "
"background task finishes. No watch history, ratings, lists, or tracked media "
"is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Los resultados de búsqueda quedan obsoletos para todos los usuarios hasta "
"que se vuelvan a obtener. El historial y Explorar se reconstruyen mientras "
"navegas, y Estadísticas muestra marcadores de posición hasta que finaliza "
"una tarea en segundo plano. No se elimina ningún historial de visionado, "
"valoración, lista ni contenido seguido."

